1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,667
Sometimes, you know something doesn't feel right.

2
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:06,900
But finding the words for it isn't always easy.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,600
And when opening up feels difficult,

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,167
getting the right support can feel even further away.

5
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:20,267
What if taking care of your mental wellbeing started with simply being heard?

6
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:21,700
Meet YANA.

7
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,367
You Are Not Alone.

8
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,067
Start at your own pace.

9
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:28,233
Check in with how you're feeling,

10
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:30,333
explore what matters to you,

11
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:33,167
and find a space that understands your needs.

12
00:00:33,933 --> 00:00:35,867
Reflect through journaling.

13
00:00:35,867 --> 00:00:38,367
Discover bite-sized guidance.

14
00:00:38,367 --> 00:00:39,933
Share your thoughts

15
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,500
and connect with a supportive community.

16
00:00:43,433 --> 00:00:45,300
And when you're ready for more,

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:50,133
explore individual therapy, group sessions and professional support.

18
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:53,800
Because wellbeing isn't a one-time destination.

19
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,000
It's a journey, and you don't have to take it alone.

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,933
YANA. You are not alone.
